{"articleNo":"342327","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=342327&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[4차산업혁명혁신선도대학사업단] 겨울방학 중 집중교육 수강생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.01.20","hit":"23838","attachments":[{"name":"방학중집중교육 수강신청서 양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=342327&attachNo=108236"},{"name":"Autodesk Certified User 퓨전360 국제자격증 취득 과정 커리큘럼.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=342327&attachNo=108278"},{"name":"AutoCad 국제자격증 커리큘럼.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=342327&attachNo=108279"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">자세한 교육사항은 추후 공지 됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&lt;교육일정&gt;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">교육대상: 참여학과 (기계시스템공학과, 산업공학부, 정보전자전공, 전자 및 전파전공, 전자IT융합전공,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 컴퓨터공학과, 컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">※참여학과 학생들이 우선 순위이나 모집 미달시 비참여학과 학생도 수강 가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">모집인원은 20명 내외입니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><strike>2/7~11 : TRIZ LEVEL 1,2 (총 40시간 교육)&nbsp;</strike></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">2/14~16 : CAD (총 30시간 교육. 이틀은 온라인 교육 하루는 오프라인 시험)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">-&gt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\">Autodesk Certified User AutoCad 국제자격증</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px; line-height: 2;\"><strike><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">2/17~21 : 3D 프린팅(퓨전360)&nbsp;&nbsp;(총 30시간.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">이틀은 온라인 교육 하루는 오프라인 시험)</span></strike></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">※자격증 응시료는 자부담입니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.72px; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 228, 0);\">TRIZ 교육과 3D프린팅 교육은 모집인원 미달로 개설 취소 되었습니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">&lt;신청일정&gt;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">접수기한: 1/28 (금) 17:00까지</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">신청서를 작성하여 woon77@kumoh.ac.kr 회신</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.72px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: NanumSquare, dotum, sans-ser